      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 0,
      "text": "Letters, Orders and Instructions. Odober 1755275.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line000.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 1,
      "text": "for Bread; the Commissary having no orders to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line001.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 2,
      "text": "make provision for you. Pfany of your men",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line002.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 3,
      "text": "should desert or die, you are immediately to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line003.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 4,
      "text": "Recruit others, keeping your Company to the Esta-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line004.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 5,
      "text": "Llishment.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line005.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 6,
      "text": "25th. To Lieutenant Bacon, of the Maryland",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line006.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 7,
      "text": "Independant Company.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line007.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 8,
      "text": "Sir",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line008.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 9,
      "text": "As those Stockades on Pattersons Creek,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line009.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 10,
      "text": "are only intended by way of cover to the Rangers, and",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line010.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 11,
      "text": "as a Receptacle now and then for Provisions; you are",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line011.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 12,
      "text": "desired not to plan any work, which requires much",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line012.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 13,
      "text": "time to execute- we have neither men nor Toolo,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line013.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 14,
      "text": "to cary on the undertaking with vigour.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line014.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 15,
      "text": "Iam c. GW",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line015.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 16,
      "text": "208th. To Lieutenant Colonel Adam Stephen,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line016.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 17,
      "text": "of the Virginia Regiment.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line017.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 18,
      "text": "You are hereby ordered, so soon as",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line018.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 19,
      "text": "the waggons arrive from Alexandria and Fort",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line019.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 20,
      "text": "Cumbertand, with Clothing and Arms, to see",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line020.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 21,
      "text": "the men completely furnished with both; and",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line021.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 22,
      "text": "march them immediately to Fort Cumberland;",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line022.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 23,
      "text": "observing to take up all the Solt which the",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line023.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 24,
      "text": "waggons, provided by the commissary, uill carry.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line024.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 25,
      "text": "There will come down some of the country wag-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line025.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 26,
      "text": "gons, which must also be loaded up with Salt.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line026.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 27,
      "text": "As there is some clothing wanting to complett",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line027.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 28,
      "text": "the Companies at Fort Cumberland, you are",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line028.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 29,
      "text": "to take up for that purpose forty Coats, thirtynine-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line029.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 30,
      "text": "waistcoats, and fifty- six pair of Breeches; thirty-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line030.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 31,
      "text": "eight Hats and eighty Shirts; which you are to have-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/273/273_line031.png"
    }
